<title>UK: Wedderburn to buy oil company.</title>
<headline>Wedderburn to buy oil company.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wedderburn Securities Plc said on Thursday it has agreed in principle to buy &quot;a company engaged in oil&quot;.</p>
<p>Wedderburn, which is quoted on the Alternative Investment Market (AIM), said in a statement that it will set out the terms of the deal in the future.</p>
<p>Trading in the company's shares were suspended today at 24-1/2p.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
